WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:01.996
You learn in one place.

00:00:02.106 --> 00:00:03.204
Build in another.

00:00:03.314 --> 00:00:05.107
Track your progress nowhere.

00:00:05.216 --> 00:00:07.894
And every AI conversation starts from zero.

00:00:10.127 --> 00:00:11.348
Meet Placiq.

00:00:11.398 --> 00:00:13.952
Your AI-native Career Intelligence OS.

00:00:16.477 --> 00:00:19.281
One workspace, where everything you do connects.

00:00:20.348 --> 00:00:21.870
