00:01:04.321 --> 00:01:08.695
Diagnose. Prioritize. Learn. Build. Evidence. Present. Reassess.

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.021
Every step feeds the next,

00:01:12.871 --> 00:01:14.314
